          "title": "I до выстрела",
          "text": ":",
          "math": "$$I_0 = \\frac{8mR^2}{2} + (4m+m)\\left(\\frac{R}{2}\\right)^2 = 4mR^2 + \\frac{5mR^2}{4} = \\frac{21mR^2}{4}$$"
