          "title": "ЗСМИ",
          "text": "$I_0\\omega_0 = I_1\\omega + m\\frac{R}{2}V$.\n$\\omega = \\frac{I_0\\omega_0 - mRV/2}{I_1} = \\frac{21mR^2\\omega_0/4 - mRV/2}{5mR^2}$.",
          "math": "$$\\boxed{\\omega = \\frac{21R\\omega_0 - 2V}{20R}}$$"
        }
      ],
      "formula": "\\omega = \\frac{21R\\omega_0 - 2V}{20R}"
    },
